WEBVTT

00:01:09.150 --> 00:01:10.420
Foolish Moe.

00:01:10.420 --> 00:01:13.460
How is that a "perfect plan"?

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:15.480
Please wait, Great Emperor.

00:01:15.480 --> 00:01:19.020
Prince Moe is the only one of the three
 who has his shit together.

00:01:19.020 --> 00:01:22.970
I believe he watched TV 
series to study women.

00:01:23.230 --> 00:01:25.530
Earthlings are so strange.

00:01:25.530 --> 00:01:27.810
Cruel mother-in-laws and money-minded mothers,

00:01:27.810 --> 00:01:29.960
wild wives and useless fathers.

00:01:29.960 --> 00:01:30.970
How amusing.

00:01:30.970 --> 00:01:33.810
Have you even gone to work 
lately, you stupid old man?

00:01:33.810 --> 00:01:36.150
Earthlings are truly strange.

00:01:36.150 --> 00:01:39.380
They worry when you're 
home and when you're not.

00:01:39.380 --> 00:01:41.840
If you have nothing to do, 
cut that watermelon.

00:01:41.840 --> 00:01:44.500
Guess I'll show off my ability.

00:01:44.860 --> 00:01:47.270
What? Is this...

00:01:47.270 --> 00:01:50.290
Yes, the detox soup that had 
all of America trembling.

00:01:50.290 --> 00:01:53.970
I call it, "Sacred Watermelon Juice: 
Agonizingly Swaying Wild Bloom."

00:01:50.460 --> 00:01:54.840
<b>Detox Soup That Had All of America Trembling
Holy Watermelon Juice: Agonizingly Swaying Wild Bloom</b>

00:01:53.970 --> 00:01:56.410
That title's too long! And what're 
you gonna do about this?!

00:01:56.410 --> 00:01:58.480
The table's all wet! 
You'd better clean it up—

00:01:58.480 --> 00:02:00.760
Shh. Take in the taste.

00:02:00.760 --> 00:02:01.720
My sacred love...

00:02:02.870 --> 00:02:05.640
...will detox even your withered heart.

00:02:06.170 --> 00:02:08.280
<i>I swallowed it.</i>

00:02:08.280 --> 00:02:10.010
<i>This sweet and refreshing fruit juice...</i>

00:02:10.010 --> 00:02:12.190
<i>My heart was full of complaints, 
but they vanished in a flash.</i>

00:02:12.190 --> 00:02:14.640
<i>It's like a whole different world.</i>

00:02:14.960 --> 00:02:17.280
<i>As I stand on a ground that 
the sun's blazing down on,</i>

00:02:17.280 --> 00:02:20.220
<i>the moment I think the hot 
breeze will burn my lungs,</i>

00:02:20.220 --> 00:02:22.280
<i>a dazzling illusion overcomes me!</i>

00:02:22.660 --> 00:02:24.380
What're you spacing out for?

00:02:24.910 --> 00:02:27.160
Direct sunlight is bad for your skin.

00:02:25.160 --> 00:02:27.160
<b>Melon Sporty Guy</b>

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:30.130
Here. Feels nice and cool, doesn't it?

00:02:30.130 --> 00:02:31.400
<i>What is this feeling?</i>

00:02:31.400 --> 00:02:34.290
<i>The impulse to punch him turned into a 
lovely je t'aime, and I'm falling in love!</i>

00:02:34.590 --> 00:02:40.800
<b>Melon Shota</b>

00:02:35.420 --> 00:02:38.670
Stay by my side forever and ever, Min-neechan!

00:02:38.670 --> 00:02:40.880
If you do, I'll do whatever you want!

00:02:41.180 --> 00:02:45.720
<b>Melon Punk</b>

00:02:41.250 --> 00:02:42.790
Hang on tight!

00:02:42.790 --> 00:02:46.470
But there's watermelon juice 
leaking from your head!

00:02:46.180 --> 00:02:52.600
<b>Melon Enigma</b>

00:02:46.470 --> 00:02:47.860
Don't try to act tough.

00:02:47.860 --> 00:02:49.360
We're the only ones here.

00:02:49.360 --> 00:02:50.980
Even if you yell, nobody will hear you.

00:02:50.980 --> 00:02:52.650
This juicy kabedon is making me go "hng!"

00:02:52.940 --> 00:02:56.280
<b>Melon Princes</b>

00:02:52.980 --> 00:02:55.820
Sowing the seeds of love and 
hope all over the world,

00:02:55.820 --> 00:02:58.170
we are the lively teen idol group:

00:02:58.170 --> 00:02:59.570
Melon Princes!

00:02:59.780 --> 00:03:04.070
Sow the seeds! Make them 
bloom! Pluck the buds!

00:03:01.170 --> 00:03:04.070
Stick it in! Dig it up!

00:03:04.600 --> 00:03:06.610
Why am I feeling such emotion

00:03:06.610 --> 00:03:08.950
just from a mouthful of watermelon?

00:03:10.050 --> 00:03:14.030
Isn't it perfect? In the era to come, 
gourmet food will make people happy.

00:03:14.030 --> 00:03:15.440
Holy shit! Prince Moe is nuts!

00:03:15.440 --> 00:03:17.610
He conquered the female glober in a second!

00:03:17.610 --> 00:03:20.300
Instead of fertilizer, 
he used something else!

00:03:20.300 --> 00:03:22.090
Enough! Turn that off!

00:03:22.360 --> 00:03:24.750
I don't want to watch this farce!

00:03:24.750 --> 00:03:25.490
Sir!

00:03:25.800 --> 00:03:28.110
Why is the Great Emperor so irritated?

00:03:28.110 --> 00:03:31.640
Watch your mouth! Did you forget why 
he wants to take over the universe?

00:03:31.640 --> 00:03:35.410
He's trying to wipe out half-baked 
feelings and emotions!

00:03:35.410 --> 00:03:36.450
Watch the flashback!

00:03:36.820 --> 00:03:38.280
You moron!

00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:41.410
We are one of the most 
prestigious noble families in the universe!

00:03:41.410 --> 00:03:43.940
Why was a good-for-nothing like you
 born into our family?

00:03:43.940 --> 00:03:46.170
We are leaving the house 
and going far, far away.

00:03:48.600 --> 00:03:50.020
Don't be depressed, Great-niisama.

00:03:50.020 --> 00:03:52.390
I know you are a kind person at heart.

00:03:52.390 --> 00:03:54.760
I will support and protect you!

00:03:55.940 --> 00:03:59.050
I'm glad I have a childhood friend like you.

00:03:59.050 --> 00:04:02.820
I know! I'll stay over at your place 
tonight and make you some yummy curry!

00:04:03.790 --> 00:04:05.100
See you later!

00:04:06.030 --> 00:04:07.000
Please don't go!

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:10.000
If you die, who will protect me?!

00:04:10.430 --> 00:04:12.390
Damn, she's not as cute without her ears.

00:04:13.360 --> 00:04:16.380
Hey, the kid over there. Lick my high heels.

00:04:16.380 --> 00:04:17.900
You want to hum-heel-iate me?!

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:22.100
Talk back to me one more time, and I'll 
stick my used pan***s in your mouth!

00:04:22.100 --> 00:04:23.610
God, no. But I'm getting 
excited. What do I do?

00:04:23.870 --> 00:04:26.700
Write your address in here. 
I'll come punish you at night.

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:28.030
God, no! But I'm getting excited!

00:04:28.030 --> 00:04:29.330
That's too many glasses.

00:04:29.710 --> 00:04:31.000
Caught you red-handed!

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:33.950
If you want my underwear, go to my website.

00:04:33.950 --> 00:04:37.070
It's http://www.megane-one.com.

00:04:35.130 --> 00:04:38.000
Advertising an online 
shop now? How tenacious!

00:04:37.070 --> 00:04:39.550
I've written everything on there!

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:39.180
But I'm getting excited!

00:04:40.170 --> 00:04:42.070
What're you spacing out for, Great?

00:04:42.070 --> 00:04:44.380
If you don't hurry, you'll be 
late for school. Tsuntsun.

00:04:44.620 --> 00:04:47.440
That's a relief! Finally, an orthodox 
heroine has shown up!

00:04:47.440 --> 00:04:48.520
Why are you staring?

00:04:48.520 --> 00:04:52.380
You don't think I'll be with you, do you?

00:04:52.380 --> 00:04:52.890
Deredere.

00:04:54.860 --> 00:04:56.010
Sorry, Great.

00:04:56.010 --> 00:04:58.720
I wanted to talk to you more 
but didn't have the courage,

00:04:58.720 --> 00:05:01.270
so I pretended to be mad at 
you to hide that I cared.

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:05.150
She came to my place, didn't she?

00:05:05.150 --> 00:05:06.450
How could this be?

00:05:06.450 --> 00:05:09.340
I was the one who was cursed!

00:05:07.490 --> 00:05:09.660
<b>Cursed</b>

00:05:09.990 --> 00:05:13.710
Why? Why is this anime so 
different from others?!

00:05:13.710 --> 00:05:16.350
Want... Want...

00:05:13.710 --> 00:05:17.080
I'm just like the other useless, 
good-natured, and perverted protagonists!

00:05:16.810 --> 00:05:20.820
I want multiple girlfriends at once!

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:22.590
<b>Eighth Day as a Superhero: "I Want Multiple Girlfriends at Once!"</b>

00:05:21.130 --> 00:05:23.150
How old do you think you are?

00:05:23.150 --> 00:05:25.670
I can't believe you're still straddling 
hug pillows as you sleep!

00:05:25.670 --> 00:05:27.330
We've arranged a marriage

00:05:27.330 --> 00:05:29.980
with the princess of the most 
powerful race in the universe.

00:05:28.640 --> 00:05:29.980
Prince Great,

00:05:29.980 --> 00:05:32.720
will you be true to her 
in good times and in bad,

00:05:32.720 --> 00:05:35.190
in sickness and in health,

00:05:35.190 --> 00:05:37.650
until death do you part?

00:05:37.650 --> 00:05:39.510
You'd better say "I do"!

00:05:39.810 --> 00:05:43.500
You may now kiss the bride.

00:05:41.650 --> 00:05:43.700
No... No...

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:45.530
No!

00:05:47.910 --> 00:05:48.950
Hey, Great.

00:05:49.490 --> 00:05:53.500
We've been married for ages, 
so why don't we have any children?

00:05:53.500 --> 00:05:55.000
You're blaming me?

00:05:55.370 --> 00:05:57.210
Don't you think there's 
something wrong with you?

00:06:00.510 --> 00:06:02.630
I mean, I understand your plight.

00:06:02.630 --> 00:06:05.020
Being with a princess like me,

00:06:05.020 --> 00:06:07.760
I'm sure you feel immense pressure.

00:06:07.760 --> 00:06:09.000
<i>Pressure, huh?</i>

00:06:09.300 --> 00:06:11.760
<i>Yeah, having children with you would be...</i>

00:06:11.760 --> 00:06:15.220
My mother found us a doctor, 
so let's have him check you out.

00:06:11.760 --> 00:06:16.020
<b>Space Clinic</b>

00:06:16.410 --> 00:06:19.330
The test results show there aren't 
any problems with your body.

00:06:19.330 --> 00:06:20.910
Where's your wife?

00:06:22.030 --> 00:06:23.120
What is it?

00:06:25.220 --> 00:06:27.690
Oh, the test results were on the other side.

00:06:27.690 --> 00:06:30.190
It'll be hard for you to have children, sir.

00:06:30.190 --> 00:06:31.870
But rest assured.

00:06:32.290 --> 00:06:34.790
We have the universe's best 
child vending machine,

00:06:34.790 --> 00:06:36.570
"Baby Capsule."

00:06:34.790 --> 00:06:36.870
<b>Child Vending Machine
"Baby Capsule"</b>

00:06:36.870 --> 00:06:40.790
Insert a coin here and turn this handle.

00:06:40.790 --> 00:06:43.410
If you had this, why didn't 
you say so sooner?!

00:06:43.410 --> 00:06:46.650
Were you messing with me with 
all those painful tests?!

00:06:47.010 --> 00:06:48.220
Wow, how cute.

00:06:48.220 --> 00:06:49.450
Look at this, Great.

00:06:49.450 --> 00:06:51.930
I want this complete set!

00:06:52.330 --> 00:06:55.270
After that, the Great Emperor 
was blessed with three sons.

00:06:53.720 --> 00:06:58.930
<b>First Prince                        Second Prince                     Third Prince
Moe                                         Moemoe                           Moemoemoe</b>

00:06:55.270 --> 00:06:58.680
They each had "rubrub," "eateat," and 
"fastfast" special abilities respectively,

00:06:56.430 --> 00:06:58.930
<b>Rubrub                   Eateat                    Fastfast</b>

00:06:58.680 --> 00:07:01.570
and the family lived in happiness.

00:07:01.570 --> 00:07:05.160
But that happiness didn't last long.

00:07:05.480 --> 00:07:07.230
As the princes grew up,

00:07:07.230 --> 00:07:10.230
the empress fell sick and passed away.

00:07:11.170 --> 00:07:13.630
Just before she died, she left some

00:07:13.630 --> 00:07:16.140
earth-shattering words 
for the Great Emperor.

00:07:16.630 --> 00:07:18.770
Great, I pretended to be a good wife,

00:07:18.770 --> 00:07:21.130
but when you weren't watching,

00:07:21.130 --> 00:07:23.280
I abused our kids in all sorts of ways, 
punching, kicking, and twisting them!

00:07:23.890 --> 00:07:27.170
I met with the man next door thrice a week 
in secret, and even had a child with him.

00:07:27.170 --> 00:07:30.580
But, if you remarry, this will 
be leaked to gossip sites.

00:07:30.580 --> 00:07:34.590
By the way, I never loved 
you, not even a little!

00:07:37.080 --> 00:07:39.300
After that, the Great Emperor,

00:07:39.300 --> 00:07:41.540
saddened by the loss of his beloved wife,

00:07:41.540 --> 00:07:44.600
became unable to believe 
in love and affection!

00:07:44.600 --> 00:07:48.210
He cast aside his feelings and 
decided to conquer the universe!

00:07:48.480 --> 00:07:51.870
Wherever he went, 
he brought death to couples!

00:07:52.060 --> 00:07:54.620
The strong need no emotions.

00:07:54.620 --> 00:07:56.910
Feelings are a virus that 
make people weaker.

00:07:56.910 --> 00:08:00.240
I will wipe them out from this universe.

00:08:00.240 --> 00:08:02.730
The princes were useless.

00:08:02.730 --> 00:08:05.630
I shall go myself!

00:08:11.590 --> 00:08:14.330
All right, I'm going back to my world!

00:08:14.330 --> 00:08:14.970
Are you ready?

00:08:14.970 --> 00:08:17.050
I'll take care of you-know-what.

00:08:17.370 --> 00:08:19.970
I'm less worried about shit and 
more about what comes after.

00:08:20.240 --> 00:08:22.690
I'll definitely succeed my father.

00:08:22.690 --> 00:08:25.020
My kid brother died, 
and Nii-san's just a drag queen.

00:08:25.020 --> 00:08:26.510
I can't think of anyone 
else getting the throne.

00:08:26.510 --> 00:08:27.980
I won't let anyone invade Earth!

00:08:28.220 --> 00:08:31.370
But if I have to marry Min-chan and live 
on Earth, I'll have to pay rent...

00:08:31.670 --> 00:08:33.360
I'm not letting a broke 
guy have my daughter.

00:08:33.620 --> 00:08:35.740
Don't worry, I'm here.

00:08:35.740 --> 00:08:37.650
We can all have a house share!

00:08:37.650 --> 00:08:39.370
And put on a lame home comedy?

00:08:39.650 --> 00:08:43.160
Okay, commence operation! 
Our goal: the toilet next door!

00:08:43.160 --> 00:08:45.060
Aye aye, sir!

00:08:45.370 --> 00:08:48.380
Wow, what happened here?

00:08:48.960 --> 00:08:51.960
It's like it was renovated 
while I was out shopping!

00:08:52.630 --> 00:08:53.340
Isn't it perfect?

00:08:54.220 --> 00:08:57.140
Oh, no wonder there were 
so many boxes outside.

00:08:57.550 --> 00:09:00.020
Did you clean up my room, too?

00:09:01.550 --> 00:09:04.070
Hey, what's with these new clothes?

00:09:04.070 --> 00:09:07.420
<i>All women are weak to the new 
and shiny, as well as money.</i>

00:09:07.420 --> 00:09:09.060
<i>This is common knowledge in soap operas.</i>

00:09:09.440 --> 00:09:11.570
Oh? Is Min-chan moving?

00:09:11.570 --> 00:09:14.450
No way. The home loan isn't paid off yet.

00:09:17.320 --> 00:09:18.390
<i>This is...</i>

00:09:22.570 --> 00:09:25.970
What'd you do with the box under 
my bed, you rotten old man?

00:09:26.670 --> 00:09:28.710
It was covered in dust, so I threw it out.

00:09:28.710 --> 00:09:31.410
Don't move my stuff without asking!

00:09:32.380 --> 00:09:33.280
Tch.

00:09:35.330 --> 00:09:36.130
This is...

00:09:41.390 --> 00:09:43.470
You stupid old man! That box had...

00:09:43.470 --> 00:09:46.660
Oh, these are Min-chan's old panties.

00:09:45.730 --> 00:09:46.960
Such a nice smell.

00:09:46.660 --> 00:09:48.030
White and blue stripes are the best!

00:09:54.130 --> 00:09:56.990
H-Hear me out, Min-chan.

00:09:57.870 --> 00:09:59.980
Neighbors are esteemed guests.

00:09:59.980 --> 00:10:01.600
Let's treat them to dinner.

00:10:01.900 --> 00:10:05.000
The food's ready, too.
